posed but no implementation and testing are provided.
Clearly, WSN based on the ZigBee standard is an appropri-
ate or good option for indoor air quality monitoring, which is
also the framework that we choose for our design.
B. Sensor Node
Sensor  node  or  array  with  multiple  sensors  is  used  to
collect  air  pollution  readings,  from  which  the  overall  air
quality level can be derived. As shown, there are three major
types of gas sensors – the metal oxide semiconductor (MOS),
electrochemical and  optical sensor  –  available for  air  quality
monitoring. Each type of sensors has unique features. Table V
summarizes the features of these sensor types from the tech-
nical  specifications  of  Figaro  Eng.  Inc.  [26]–[28]  and  other
online sources.
The   sensor   types   and   number   of   sensors   included   in
