A poluição do ar e o sistema respiratório*
Air pollution and the respiratory system
Marcos Abdo Arbex, Ubiratan de Paula Santos,  
Lourdes Conceição Martins, Paulo Hilário Nascimento Saldiva,  
Luiz Alberto Amador Pereira, Alfésio Luis Ferreira Braga
Resumo
A poluição atmosférica encontra-se presente nos mais diferentes cenários ao longo dos últimos 250 anos, desde 
que a Revolução Industrial acelerou o processo de emissão de poluentes que, até então, estava limitado ao uso 
doméstico de combustíveis vegetais e minerais e às emissões vulcânicas intermitentes. Hoje, aproximadamente 50% 
da população do planeta vivem em cidades e aglomerados urbanos e estão expostas a níveis progressivamente 
maiores de poluentes do ar. Este estudo é uma revisão não sistemática sobre os diferentes tipos e fontes de 
poluentes do ar e os efeitos respiratórios atribuídos à exposição a esses contaminantes. Podem ser creditados', '{"loc":{"lines":{"to":13,"from":1}},"pdf":{"info":{"Creator":"Adobe InDesign CS5.5 (7.5.3)","ModDate":"D:20121011092604-03''00''","Producer":"Adobe PDF Library 9.9","CreationDate":"D:20121011092541-03''00''","IsXFAPresent":false,"PDFFormatVersion":"1.6","IsAcroFormPresent":false},"version":"1.10.100","metadata":{"_metadata":{"dc:format":"application/pdf","pdf:producer":"Adobe PDF Library 9.9","xmp:createdate":"2012-10-11T09:25:41-03:00","xmp:modifydate":"2012-10-11T09:26:04-03:00","xmp:creatortool":"Adobe InDesign CS5.5 (7.5.3)","xmp:metadatadate":"2012-10-11T09:26:04-03:00","xmpmm:documentid":"uuid:605d65db-8687-4462-b6ae-22eabbdd3a77","xmpmm:instanceid":"uuid:225ac490-7b36-4902-9d95-ba6f39dc3ab2"}},"totalPages":13},"source":"blob","blobType":"application/pdf"}', '[0.011393512,0.022722226,0.010669943,0.025378913,-0.02356459,0.027776409,-0.026761252,-0.041772608,-0.036977615,0.01818642,-0.007435481,-0.0071006957,-0.0026944845,-0.013348227,0.00466,0.00862883,-0.00022999638,3.8942667e-06,0.04989386,-0.0028834764,0.021069897,0.0020424624,-0.00066653395,-0.021480279,-0.0210051,-0.07823185,-0.013607416,-0.014568576,-0.011274717,0.036113653,0.01795963,-0.029569132,0.01236547,0.020583918,0.016771682,0.0009922074,-0.040044684,-0.0186292,0.011944287,0.010475551,0.058187906,0.0027889805,-0.023521392,0.010459351,-0.014827765,0.0072410894,0.0012453216,-0.019039584,0.0559416,-0.0034180535,-0.01749525,0.02380218,0.010983129,-0.07067217,0.05550962,-0.03378095,-0.020367926,0.03146985,0.005205377,-0.03213942,0.037172005,-0.031383455,-0.03596246,0.030173907,-0.07607194,0.011976686,0.0326362,-0.018953187,-0.008699027,-0.01798123,0.036437638,0.02749562,-0.010912932,-0.046006028,-0.02121029,-0.03689122,0.0022922016,-0.0076622716,-0.007257289,0.022635829,-0.024622945,0.019007185,-0.02820839,0.009935574,-0.048252333,-0.04369493,-0.044494092,0.02076751,-0.030821878,-0.022679027,