data. The performance of regional models such as CALPUFF was pre-
viously tested in similar coastal regions in Turkey (Elbir et al., 2010;
Elbir,2003,2004).Theresultsindicatedthattheperformanceofthese
models was not remarkably different from AERMOD, when a single
meteorological station was available in the modelling domain. In this
study, the surface meteorological data was obtained from the central
meteorologicalstationlocatedinthecitycenterfortheyear2013and
the upper air data was also obtained from the nearest upper-air
soundingstationinIstanbul.
