qualitylevels(USEPA,2004).AERMODisthesteady-stateplumedis-
persion model designed to predict near field concentrations in urban
areas using hourly surface and upper air meteorological observations
from a single meteorological station. AERMOD is the regulatory dis-
persionmodelinTurkeyrequiredbytheMinistryofEnvironmentand
Urbanization for the studies of environmental impact assessment and
emission permit (MEU, 2020a,b). Besides this legal obligation, it was
preferred rather than other regional models since there was one me-
