Lung formation 
and growth
PM
2.5
Exposure leads to a reduced 
number of alveoli and 
impaired lung function in 
adult mice.
PM
10
:  particulate  matter  with  an  aerodynamic  diameter  less  than  10  μm;  PM
2.5
:  particulate  matter  with  an  
aerodynamic diameter less than 2.5 μm; and NO
x
: nitrogen oxides.
