ser agudos ou crônicos. Os efeitos agudos se 
manifestam após um curto espaço de tempo 
entre a exposição e os efeitos (horas ou dias). 
Os efeitos crônicos são avaliados geralmente 
em estudos longitudinais com duração de anos 
ou décadas.
(8)
 O Quadro 2 resume os efeitos 
agudos e crônicos dos poluentes sobre o sistema 
respiratório.
Grupos suscetíveis
Crianças
As crianças apresentam grande suscetibilidade 
à exposição aos poluentes aéreos. Apresentam 
maior ventilação minuto devido ao metabolismo 
basal acelerado e à maior atividade física quando 
comparados aos adultos, além de permanecerem 
por mais tempo em ambientes externos. Tomando 
como base o peso corporal, o volume de ar que 
passa através das vias respiratórias da criança 
em repouso é o dobro daquele nos adultos em 
condições semelhantes. A irritação pelos poluentes 
que produziria uma débil resposta em adultos pode 
resultar potencialmente em significante obstrução', '{"loc":{"lines":{"to":421,"from":397}},"pdf":{"info":{"Creator":"Adobe InDesign CS5.5 (7.5.3)","ModDate":"D:20121011092604-03''00''","Producer":"Adobe PDF Library 9.9","CreationDate":"D:20121011092541-03''00''","IsXFAPresent":false,"PDFFormatVersion":"1.6","IsAcroFormPresent":false},"version":"1.10.100","metadata":{"_metadata":{"dc:format":"application/pdf","pdf:producer":"Adobe PDF Library 9.9","xmp:createdate":"2012-10-11T09:25:41-03:00","xmp:modifydate":"2012-10-11T09:26:04-03:00","xmp:creatortool":"Adobe InDesign CS5.5 (7.5.3)","xmp:metadatadate":"2012-10-11T09:26:04-03:00","xmpmm:documentid":"uuid:605d65db-8687-4462-b6ae-22eabbdd3a77","xmpmm:instanceid":"uuid:225ac490-7b36-4902-9d95-ba6f39dc3ab2"}},"totalPages":13},"source":"blob","blobType":"application/pdf"}', '[0.01396162,0.026041735,0.03142968,0.037116956,-0.010615535,0.027410101,-0.010081016,-0.054948486,-0.016452475,0.02094243,-0.0044952994,-0.02591345,-0.009813757,0.004492627,0.005452087,-0.0033861739,0.012593253,-0.024823032,0.023818139,-0.014592351,0.02181904,0.0285219,0.013897478,-0.0076970644,0.0025322807,-0.08731892,0.02621278,-0.035064403,0.021915253,0.03872051,0.027880477,-0.015458271,-0.003998197,0.004628929,0.0021487637,0.00018123513,-0.038549464,-0.012048044,-0.023925042,-0.018515715,0.019071614,0.0039180196,-0.044942304,-0.021209689,-0.031280015,0.0027901859,-0.027837716,-0.008552294,0.049688827,0.038228754,-0.013405721,0.020867597,-0.00552692,-0.012646704,0.070984036,-0.027966,-0.0006016672,0.0007456531,0.0098832445,-0.028137047,0.048534267,-0.0016115728,-0.021198997,0.030446166,-0.049646065,0.035256833,0.017810151,-0.013202604,-0.06773417,-0.020504124,0.015362058,0.0062324842,0.02240701,-0.043830507,-0.03258424,0.0020899668,0.01632419,-0.06384287,-0.005901083,0.024823032,-0.0021594542,-0.00020077846,-0.018815046,0.03581273,-0.030424785,-0.03350361,-0.034166414,-0.023262238,-0.015607936,-0.016815947,-0.03899846,0.012839131,-0.047294185,0.00