Chao-Hsien  Chuis  currently  a Professor  of  Infor-
mation Sciences  and Technology  with Pennsylvania
State  University,  University  Park,  PA,  USA,  where
he  received  the  Ph.D.  degree  in  business  in  1984.
He  is  the  Founding  Director  of  the  Smart  Sensing
Laboratory   at  Pennsylvania   State  University.   His
research  interests  include  technologies  and  applica-
tions  of  Internet  of  things  and  cyber  physical  sys-
tems, intelligent  technologies  and their applications,
and  information  security  and  privacy  assurance.  He
has authored  over 180  papers, many  of them  are in
