Fig. 6.Information  flow for sensor information  processing.
Another problem with  sensory  array  is  the  lack  of  the  long-
term stability. This problem can be solved by auto-calibration
method [17] and initialized-calibration. Every MOS gas sensor
has  distinctive  characteristics  in  the  beginning  of  sensing
operation [15]. In our system, the initialized-calibration is used
to  resolve  the  long-term  stability  by  checking  the  initialized
action periodically.
H. Context Aware Services Design
