Keywords—   indoor   air quality,    indoor   lighting   quality, 
environmental  medicine, respiratory impairment, wireless sensor 
network (WSN), internet of things (IoT),  web application 
I. INTRODUCTION 
Air  pollution  is  one  of  the  greatest  environmental  risks  for  
human  health  and  it  can  lead  to  a  variety  of  health  problems  
related to respiratory diseases.  Chronic  obstructive pulmonary 
