F. Power Consumption
There are three main sources that consume power/energy –
sensors,datacommunicationsanddataprocessing.
Among   which   sensors   consume   much   more   power   than
the other two sources. Table VIsummarizes the sensors used,
sensor  type  and  ranges  of  power  consumption  [26]–[28].
As  shown,  electrochemical  type  of  sensor  is  more  power
