When  all  three  gas  sensors  were  operating  with  high  energy  
consumption  levels,  a  value  of  474  mAh  was  presented  when  
on sleep mode and approximately 570 mAh when transmitting 
data. Powered   by   a   10400   mAh   power-bank,   this   node   
presented approximately 20 hours of autonomy. 
