Paulo and Belo Horizonte. Even though this work estimated
risks specifically for São Paulo, it was also used in Belo
Horizonte due to the lack of risk estimations for this city for
the lags investigated. For Vitória, RRs from Freitas et al.
(2016) and Souza et al. (2018) (PM
10
