reducing emissions. Expansion of public transportation, 
the use of cleaner fuels in vehicles, industries, and 
households, as well as a change in building construction 
standards, which require a lot of energy, are feasible 
and necessary measures to reduce global warming and 
its direct effects on human health.
(99)
 It is estimated 
that reducing emission levels to those recommended 
by the WHO and the Paris Agreement can lead to up to 
60% decrease in pollution-related deaths annually. 
(11)
 
In this context, physicians should be able to inform 
and advise the population about healthy eating habits, 
regular physical exercise, and chronic disease control. 
Physicians  should  also  contribute  to  strengthening  
the necessary measures to reduce emissions in favor 
of environmental recovery. The current SARS-CoV-2 
virus pandemic, which follows the SARS and MERS 
outbreaks  in  2000  and  2012,  respectively,  shows', '{"loc":{"lines":{"to":1594,"from":1573}},"pdf":{"info":{"Creator":"Adobe InDesign 14.0 (Macintosh)","ModDate":"D:20210119135514-03''00''","Trapped":{"name":"False"},"Producer":"Adobe PDF Library 15.0","CreationDate":"D:20210119135511-03''00''","IsXFAPresent":false,"PDFFormatVersion":"1.7","IsAcroFormPresent":false},"version":"1.10.100","metadata":{"_metadata":{"dc:format":"application/pdf","pdf:trapped":"False","pdf:producer":"Adobe PDF Library 15.0","xmpmm:history":"convertedfrom application/x-indesign to application/pdfAdobe InDesign CC 14.0 (Macintosh)/2021-01-19T13:55:11-03:00","xmp:createdate":"2021-01-19T13:55:11-03:00","xmp:modifydate":"2021-01-19T13:55:14-03:00","xmp:creatortool":"Adobe InDesign 14.0 (Macintosh)","xmp:metadatadate":"2021-01-19T13:55:14-03:00","xmpmm:documentid":"xmp.id:745138dd-fe63-48ba-93bc-0508ad07d81f","xmpmm:instanceid":"uuid:fdfe56da-0d67-a747-9ab6-ac6d599c5fb5","xmpmm:derivedfrom":"xmp.iid:fac0d1b4-9cc4-42b3-8e1b-899900084d24xmp.did:443df8f5-b9f4-4e01-96ed-83168bce5035xmp.did:830CD6AF9C2BE511B775E2600CA57E1Bdefault","xmpmm:renditionclass":"proof:pdf","xmpmm:originaldocumentid":"xmp.did:830CD6AF9C2BE511B775E2600CA57E1B","extensisfontsenseslug:slug":"Univers1.0000MilesTrueType1459906932Univers-Bold1459906932Univers 45 Light1.000AgfaTrueType2228420894Univers-Light2228420894Minion Pro2.10800Adobe SystemsOpenType - PS4058168798MinionPro-Regular4058168798Times6.0063825Apple ComputerTrueType3299780283Times-Roman3299780283"}},"totalPages":13},"source":"blob","blobType":"application/pdf"}', '[0.020107009,-0.00975728,0.08076658,0.054408625,-0.02851012,0.010041414,-0.010192549,0.021340271,-0.011661582,0.047516864,0.023093438,0.006516944,-0.021606268,0.003950671,0.018680295,-0.019526651,0.015984045,0.032838628,0.0393193,0.01724149,0.024350882,0.014170424,0.02176345,0.027131768,-0.02807485,-0.03153282,0.022416353,0.014436422,0.044494163,-0.03317717,0.014932144,-0.0037723312,-0.021582088,-0.0